menu "Fireside"

    config FIRESIDE_TOUCH_DIAG
        bool "Enable touch/LVGL diagnostic probes"
        default n
        help
            Installs the perf.c diagnostic probes: LVGL task stall
            watchdog (logs when the LVGL task blocks >200 ms), raw touch
            DOWN/UP transition sampler, and keyboard VALUE_CHANGED event
            logging. Diagnosis builds only — the probes cost CPU and log
            bandwidth on the LVGL task and must stay off in normal
            builds.

endmenu
